# Local fixtures (DIF/Lotus/MDB corpora) are downloaded by hand from
# sembiance.com and mdbtools/mdbtestdata; they live in this directory
# only when a developer runs the corpus pipeline. They are not source and
# not committed: a CI run picks them up if a `scripts/fetch-legacy-corpus.sh`
# step is added, but the binary fixtures themselves are git-ignored so a
# clone stays small.
*
